@startuml
|Higher Studies Coordinator|
start
:Review Submitted record; enter reason;
|Web UI / API|
:Send request;
|Application Service|
:Check role, state and nonblank reason;
if (Valid correction request?) then (yes)
  |Repository / Database|
  :Begin transaction;
  :Insert decision; set Correction Required; audit; notify student;
  :Commit;
  |Web UI / API|
  :Show success;
else (no)
  |Web UI / API|
  :Show reason or eligibility error;
endif
stop
@enduml
